{"id":1181,"level":74,"name":"Перевантажені фігури","group":"Перевантаження","format":27,"description":"<p>Sometimes a defender has too many tasks. It tries to protect two pieces at once. In case of attack, the defender can save only one. And you can take the other. A piece with a double task is called an <em>overloaded piece</em> or an <em>overworked piece</em>. It is simply too busy.</p>  <p>Ask yourself this question:<br />Which enemy piece is doing two defensive jobs at the same time?</p>  <p><strong>What do you have to do?</strong><br />Make the best use of an overload and win material.</p>","assignment":"","stickerID":76,"examples":[{"fen":"r1bq1rk1/2p1bppp/p7/np1n4/3N4/1BP5/PP3PPP/RNBQR1K1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Gf6][%cal Gd1d4]} {[#]} 1. Qd4# 1-0","text":"","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":40837,"fen":"5rk1/1b2pp2/pq4p1/2RPn1Pp/Pp2P3/3BQ2P/1P4P1/5NK1 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Re3]} 1... Nxd3 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":49661,"fen":"7q/r4p1k/2rB1Qp1/4PpRp/p1P1b2P/8/P5P1/2R3K1 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%cal Ye5f6,Ye5d6]} 1... Qxf6 2. exf6 Rxd6 (2... Rd7?  ) 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":49303,"fen":"4b3/1p2q1k1/p3p1p1/P2pn1N1/8/2PB2QP/1P4PK/8 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%cal Yg3d3,Yg3g5]} 1... Nxd3 2. Qxd3 Qxg5 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":49220,"fen":"6k1/4p2p/1Qbp4/4n3/1PP2p1q/5P2/4B1PP/3N2K1 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yd1,Re2,Yf1]} 1... Qe1+ {[%csl Re2,Rg1]} 2. Bf1 Qxd1 -+ (2... Bxf3?   -/+ {not the best move}) 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":40838,"fen":"r5k1/b4ppp/p1N1pn2/8/P7/4P3/4NPPP/2R3K1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Ra8]} 1. Nxa7 Rxa7 2. Rc8+ 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41147,"fen":"2rqr1k1/1p3pbp/p2B2p1/n7/PQ1p4/6P1/1P2PPBP/2R2RK1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rd8]} 1. Rxc8 Qxc8 2. Qxa5 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"